senses.gloss:
श्यान, अस्, आ, अम्, gone; coagulated, congealed;
viscous, thick, sticky, adhesive (as clarified butter);
shrunk up, shrunk; (अम्), n. smoke.
—श्यान-
पुलिन, अस्, आ, अम्, having shrunk or dry sand-
banks (as a river in the hot season).

श्यामक, अस्, m. a kind of edible grain, (Panicum
Frumentaceum or Colonum); a gramineous plant;
(अम्), n. a kind of grass (= रोहिष-तृण).

श्यावक, अस्, आ, अम्, brown, bay; (अस्), m., Ved.,
N. of a person under the especial protection of Indra;
(आस्), m. pl. the horses of the Sun.

श्यालक, अस्, m. a wife's brother; a poor or
miserable brother-in-law; (अकी), f. a wife's sister;
sister-in-law.

स्यन्दिन्, ई, इनी, इ, trickling, oozing, dropping;
flowing, rushing; going, moving; (इनी), f. saliva;
a cow bearing two calves at once.
